SUMMARY:2nd Annual Howl-O-Ween Dog Costume Contest with Montclair Dog at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Montclair Dog’s 2nd Annual Howl-O-Ween Costume Contest\, a spooky afternoon of boos\, brews\, and bone afide style!\n✨ Strut your pup’s stuff in our Halloween costume contest\n✨ Sips from Montclair Brewery while cheering on competitors\n✨ Shop spooky vendors and discover local favorites\n✨ Sip\, shop\, and celebrate with fellow dog lovers\n✨ Receive one complimentary dog beer with your ticket\n✨ Win prizes for the best dressed pups in multiple categories\n🎟️ $25 per dog. Every additional dog from the same household is $10\n🐾 Costume contest entry is free with your ticket\nClick the link to visit the registration page and read more about the Pup-ticipation Waiver and all event details! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
