SUMMARY:Garden State Rewind live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Garden State Rewind is a New Jersey-based party rock band bringing all your favorite hits back to the stage. With a high-energy live show packed with nostalgic hits and crowd favorites\, GSR delivers everything from alternative and pop staples to hard-hitting rock anthems. Whether it’s a packed bar or a festival stage\, Garden State Rewind is all about getting people singing\, dancing\, and remembering why they fell in love with music in the first place. \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
