SUMMARY:Fall at the MC
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Fall at the MC on Sunday\, November 1\, from 10 AM to 1 PM! Celebrate the season with a fun-filled community event featuring a DJ\, donuts\, apple cider\, face painting\, fall tastings\, and local vendors.\nPlus\, tag The MC Hotel on social media and receive a free pumpkin! \nBring your friends and family and enjoy a festive fall morning in Montclair. \nLocation: The MC Hotel\, 690 Bloomfield Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ 07042 \nWe can’t wait to celebrate fall with you! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
