SUMMARY:Free Ekphrastic Poetry Performance
DESCRIPTION:Ekphrastic Poetry Performance\nSunday\, November 1\, 2026: 2pm – 4pm\nRSVP Encouraged. Free and Open to the Public \nPoetry Inspired by The WAE Open\nLocal writers present original poems inspired by the dynamic works of art featured in The WAE Open. Each poet brings a distinct perspective\, translating visual impressions into language\, rhythm\, and performance. \nThis unique format highlights the connection between: \nVisual art and creative interpretation\nSpoken word and live performance\nIndividual reflection and shared experience\nThe result is an exciting\, unexpected art form that brings together language\, performance\, and visual art in a powerful creative exchange. \nHosted by award-winning poet\, teaching-artist\, and founder of The Write Space writing community\, Marcia LeBeau will curate this live performance. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/free-ekphrastic-poetry-performance/
