SUMMARY:Nidra Night Guided Meditation w/ Hana Konheim - Day of the Dead Edition!
DESCRIPTION:Nidra Nights invites you to let go\, release and immerse yourself in deep relaxation. \nThis special edition of Nidra Night will honor of Dia de los Muertos (Day of the Dead). The evening will invite reflection on the cycles of rest & renewal\, life & death. Costumes are welcome! \nIn this special offering\, we’ll explore the space between worlds\, between sleep and awake\, rest and renewal. Through a 40–45 minute guided Yoga Nidra practice\, we’ll settle into deep rest while remaining gently aware. \nJoin us in person or online. Register here: https://momence.com/l/QQhE6xW2 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/nidra-night-guided-meditation-w-hana-konheim-day-of-the-dead-edition/
