SUMMARY:Learn English Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Come expand your English vocabulary through great books! Learning another language also means using that language. This is a great way to read\, discuss books and learn in a safe friendly environment. Must be a second language learner (English is not your first language) who is a fairly proficient speaker. If you’re not sure but interested sign up and take a chance! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
