SUMMARY:Montclair Music Club - November Program
DESCRIPTION:Montclair Music Club \nNOVEMBER PROGRAM \n November 2nd\, 7:30 PM \n Presbyterian Church of Upper Montclair \n53 Norwood Avenue\, Montclair\, NJ \n  \nJoin us for this delightful second program of the season featuring: \n\nSoprano Karen Merchant\, tenor Ravon Middlebrooks\, with pianist Ryan Bridge and violinist Rebecca Harris-Lee\, singing works by Faure\, Massenet\, Schubert\, Strauss\, and Bernstein.\nPianist Carolyn Enger performing “Four Meditations on the Crisis of Mischling Identity”\, a work she commissioned\, by Bruce Adolphe.\nColoratura soprano Denise Silecchia with pianist Ryan Bridge singing pieces by Barber\, Debussy\, Brahms\, Rorem\, Paisiello\, Hundley\, and Gilbert and Sullivan.\nFlutists Carla Auld and Jessica Valiente playing  Hindemith and Mendelssohn duets.\n\nReception immediately following the program. \nEntrance: Enter the church on the east side of the building at the double doors. \nPlease share this announcement with family and friends. \nMMC is a 501(c)(3) organization.  Members make the 2026–’27 season possible. We appreciate your support through donations and club membership at the registration desk or online at https://montclairmusicclub.org/donate/. \nFollow MMC at: MMC Website · Facebook Page· Highlights from the 2025–’26 season on the MMC YouTube Channel \nWe look forward to seeing you! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/montclair-music-club-november-program/
LOCATION:The Presbyterian Church of Upper Montclair\, 53 Norwood Avenue\, Upper Montclair\, NJ\, 07043\, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Montclair-Music-Club-Flyer-November-2-2026-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Music Club":MAILTO:lpaparatto@gmail.com
