SUMMARY:Rory Gilmore's Book Club (Fable Integrated)
DESCRIPTION:This book is integrated with the reading app Fable. You will receive an email invite when you register; join virtually to discuss each chapter and vote on our next read! \nVirtual Buddy Read begins: Oct. 5\nIn-Person Meeting: Nov. 5 \n“I live in two worlds. One is a world of books. I’ve been a resident of Faulkner’s Yoknapatawpha County\, hunted the white whale aboard the Pequod\, fought alongside Napoleon\, sailed a raft with Huck and Jim\, committed absurdities with Ignatius J. Reilly\, rode a sad train with Anna Karenina and strolled down Swann’s Way…” \nRory Gilmore’s Book Club is not only for fans of Gilmore Girls\, it’s for anyone who wants to explore the classics and challenge themselves by reading directly from the Rory Gilmore Reading List. We’ll meet every other month at the library with coffee and treats to discuss our chosen book (please feel free to bring your favorite coffee mug!). We’ll also be chatting virtually along the way thanks to the reading app Fable! Once you register for our book club\, an invite link will be sent and you can join the app\, granting you the ability to comment forum-style on each chapter as well as vote for our next book. Our virtual buddy read will begin on October 5\, but please feel free to join in at any time! \nIf virtual book clubs aren’t your thing\, you’re also welcome to simply meet up in-person to discuss the book as a whole. \nAll are welcome! ♡ \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/rory-gilmores-book-club-fable-integrated/
LOCATION:Montclair Public Library\, 50 South Fullerton Avenue\, Montclair\, New Jersey\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Literature
