SUMMARY:Art Uncorked
DESCRIPTION:Travel to the Pacific Northwest with MAM and immerse yourself in the region’s exceptional wines\, craft beers and market hall fare\, alongside a silent art auction\, curated tasting\, unlimited bar\, and live DJ. This is your chance to bring your friends\, mix and mingle with featured artists\, bid on original artwork\, and get your art party on at your local museum! Guests are invited to visit MAM’s galleries from 5–6 p.m.; gallery admission included with ticket purchase. Check out what will be on view! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
