SUMMARY:Ed Alstrom live at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Join us and the organist for the New York Yankees for over 20 seasons\, Ed Alstrom\, for a night of fantastic live music! Ed is a premier blues performer and a past winner of the North Jersey Blues Society’s Blues Challenge for the SOLO/DUO category. \n$5 cover charge per person that goes directly to the artists. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
